No duplicate current authority found.

**Three-layer figure architecture (2026-09-29 inventory correction)**:
1. `descriptive/analysis_v2.0/figures_final_v2/` - M17 main manuscript Fig 1-6.
2. `descriptive/discovery_validation/figures_prospective_v2.7/` - discovery-validation supplementary figures (CURRENT v2.7, 15 figures, 79 root files).
3. `descriptive/figures_nature_v2.2/` - upstream QC/descriptive supplementary figures (10 producers, 649 files).

The v2.7 bundle is registered as SUPPLEMENTARY / REPRODUCIBILITY_REQUIRED; it is NOT the M17 main bundle and NOT a duplicate of `figures_final_v2/`. The v2.7 `qa_preview/` directory now contains exactly 15 current `FIG*.png` (v26/v27 prefix-stamped renders deleted during pre-freeze cleanup).

